  static const lessons = <EnglishAdvancedLesson>[
    EnglishAdvancedLesson(level:"B2",number:3,title:"The Rooftop Energy Debate",titleArabic:"الجدل حول الطاقة فوق الأسطح",storyTitle:"The Rooftop Energy Debate",storyTitleArabic:"الجدل حول الطاقة فوق الأسطح",paragraphs:<String>["When the neighborhood association proposed a shared solar installation, residents welcomed the possibility of cheaper electricity. Yet the plan required rooftop access across several buildings, and tenants asked whether the projected savings would justify the upfront investment.","An energy engineer compared seasonal output, maintenance requirements and peak demand. She cautioned that generation would fall during cloudy months, so battery storage and grid backup remained necessary. Participants debated whether households with different consumption habits should contribute equally.","During consultation, a property owner requested a clear warranty and a transparent contract. A renter argued that low-income families could not bear the same initial cost as wealthier owners. Their argument shifted from technology to financial risk and equitable access.","After negotiation, residents approved a limited pilot installation with independent monitoring. Although the project would not eliminate every electricity bill, it would provide measurable evidence before expansion. A simplistic promise had become a more accountable community decision."],storyWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("neighborhood association","جمعية الحي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("solar installation","تركيب شمسي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("rooftop access","حق استخدام السطح"),EnglishAdvancedWord("projected savings","وفورات متوقعة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("upfront investment","استثمار أولي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("energy engineer","مهندس طاقة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("seasonal output","إنتاج موسمي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("maintenance requirements","متطلبات الصيانة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("peak demand","ذروة الطلب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("battery storage","تخزين البطاريات"),EnglishAdvancedWord("grid backup","دعم الشبكة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("property owner","مالك عقار"),EnglishAdvancedWord("warranty","ضمان"),EnglishAdvancedWord("pilot installation","تركيب تجريبي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("independent monitoring","رصد مستقل"),EnglishAdvancedWord("financial risk","خطر مالي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("equitable access","وصول عادل")],extraWords:<EnglishAdvancedWord>[EnglishAdvancedWord("photovoltaic array","مصفوفة ألواح ضوئية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("inverter efficiency","كفاءة المحول"),EnglishAdvancedWord("net metering","القياس الصافي"),EnglishAdvancedWord("system lifespan","عمر النظام"),EnglishAdvancedWord("power fluctuation","تقلب القدرة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("household tariff","تعرفة منزلية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("installation permit","تصريح تركيب"),EnglishAdvancedWord("roof reinforcement","تدعيم السطح"),EnglishAdvancedWord("generation capacity","قدرة توليد"),EnglishAdvancedWord("maintenance reserve","احتياطي صيانة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("energy cooperative","تعاونية طاقة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("capital contribution","مساهمة رأسمالية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("billing transparency","شفافية الفوترة"),EnglishAdvancedWord("utility interconnection","ربط مرفق الكهرباء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("load profile","ملف الأحمال"),EnglishAdvancedWord("electricity surplus","فائض كهرباء"),EnglishAdvancedWord("financial feasibility","جدوى مالية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("community ownership","ملكية مجتمعية"),EnglishAdvancedWord("energy payback","استرداد تكلفة الطاقة")],grammarTitle:"Concession and evidence-qualified projections",grammarArabic:"نستخدم Although لعرض الحجة المضادة وprovided that لتحديد الشرط وwould للنتيجة الافتراضية. لا نقدم التوقعات الفنية كضمان مالي.",grammarExamples:<String>["Although solar panels generate power, storage remains costly.","The proposal could work provided that costs are shared fairly.","We would expand the scheme if the pilot proved successful."],listening:"The committee has recommended a small initial solar pilot rather than a full neighborhood installation. Engineers estimate that rooftop generation could reduce daytime electricity purchases, but actual savings depend on the weather, maintenance and tariff arrangements. Several tenants have questioned whether they should contribute the same amount as owners. The proposal therefore includes financial assistance for households facing hardship and requires quarterly performance reports. Supporters say the trial will reveal whether solar generation is practical under local conditions. Critics acknowledge its environmental promise but warn that estimates cannot guarantee future returns. The association will examine metering records and maintenance costs before voting on expansion.",listeningQuestion:"Why does the committee prefer a limited pilot?",listeningOptions:<String>["It provides measured evidence before expansion","It guarantees free power forever","It avoids safety inspections"],listeningAnswer:0,readingQuestion:"What central issue divided tenants and owners?",readingOptions:<String>["The fair sharing of financial costs","The color of the panels","The number of buildings in the city"],readingAnswer:0,writingCue:"A manufacturer provides a product ____ for defects.",writingAnswer:"warranty"),
